  "description": "The Kroger Co. 2019 Proxy Statement and 2018 Annual Report (fiscal year ended 2 February 2019), which reproduces the Form 10-K text. The extra week's period (13) and the label templates are illustrative; only fields the document states are asserted.",
  "source": {
    "kind": "cited",
    "citation": "\"Kroger’s fiscal year ends on the Saturday closest to January 31.\" (p. A-3) \"The reported periods conform to our fiscal calendar composed of thirteen 28-day periods. The fourth quarter of 2018 contained three 28-day periods.\" (p. A-4) \"First period - four weeks November 11, 2018 to December 8, 2018\", \"Second period - four weeks December 9, 2018 to January 5, 2019\" and \"January 6, 2019 to February 2, 2019\" (third period; Issuer Purchases of Equity Securities table, p. A-4).\"All references to 2018, 2017 and 2016 are to the fiscal years ended February 2, 2019, February 3, 2018 and January 28, 2017, respectively, unless specifically indicated otherwise.\" (p. A-5) \"The Company’s fiscal year ends on the Saturday nearest January 31. The last three fiscal years consist of the 52-week period ended February 2, 2019, 53-week period ended February 3, 2018 and 52-week period ended January 28, 2017.\" (Note 1, p. A-35) Note 21, Quarterly Data (pp. A-77 and A-78): 2018 quarters of 16, 12, 12 and 12 weeks (52 weeks); 2017 quarters of 16, 12, 12 and 13 weeks (53 weeks). Establishes the year-end rule, start-year naming, thirteen four-week periods, the three fiscal year ends and week counts, the quarter week counts, and the start and last day of the three fourth-quarter periods of 2018 (periods 11 to 13, because the 16- and 12-week quarters before them hold ten four-week periods).",
    "url": "https://s202.q4cdn.com/463742399/files/doc_financials/2018/ar/2018-Annual-Report.pdf",
    "checked_by": "Quotes compared character for character with the text that pdftotext -layout -enc UTF-8 extracted from the PDF (line breaks joined) on 2026-11-01; see research/filers/"
  },
